<p class="lede">Each month we put one writer's work at the front of the shelves.</p>

<h2>Ursula Vane</h2>
<img id="portrait-vane" class="portrait" src="/assets/photos/ursula-vane.svg" width="240" height="300"
     alt="IMG_2231.jpg">
<p>Ursula Vane grew up on the estuary and has written about it for thirty years. Her sixth novel,
  <em>Tidewater</em>, follows three generations of a family whose house is slowly taken by the sea.</p>
<p>She will be reading at Fenner Road on the last Thursday of the month.</p>
